<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto Breeder For Horse Life</Major>
    <Description>Requires some setup such as having feed and having to click on it in your inventory before you run the macro for the fastest effieciency.
Also requires you to change the 'Loop' function to however much food you have or stable slots you have.
On the breeding page make sure to type in the desired horses name in the search bar in the game so it will click on that horse instead of a random horse.
Lastly need to be on the female horse profile with the breed button as this is where the macro starts.

NOTE: uses cursor movement so resolution needs to be set at 1920x1080 in order to work properly
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
